flowchart TD
    A[Camera Captures Vehicle] --> B[Detect License Plate Region]
    B --> C[OCR / ALPR Recognition]
    C --> D{Plate Valid?}
    D -->|No| E[Send for Manual Review]
    D -->|Yes| F[Query Vehicle Database]
    F --> G{Vehicle Found?}
    G -->|No| H[Flag Unregistered Vehicle]
    G -->|Yes| I[Check Speed / Rule Conditions]
    I --> J{Violation Detected?}
    J -->|No| K[Log Non-Violation Event]
    J -->|Yes| L[Generate Fine]
    L --> M[Create Violation Record]
    M --> N[Send Notification]
